message: "If you cite or reference this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "fixragent-mcp: fixRAgent maintenance triage for property managers (MCP server)"
abstract: >-
  fixRAgent is maintenance triage for property managers, landlords and the
  companies that run buildings. One photo of something in a building becomes a
  Triage Profile: what the asset is, whether a fault is visible, how urgent it
  is in one of four words (EMERGENCY, TODAY, THIS WEEK, WHENEVER), which trade
  to call, and a line to say to the resident. The remote MCP server runs at
  https://fixragent.com/mcp; this repository holds its registry entry and an
  older one-file stdio server.
